2 CONT Hourulan isäntä ja Pyhäjoen nimismies, osti Pyhäjoen kartanon k. 1600-l alussa.
2 CONT
2 CONT Owner of Hourula, and Chief Constable of Pyhäjoki. Acquired Pyhäjoki manor at the beginning of the 17th century.
2 CONT
