1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Magdalena (Malin) Eriksdotter, born around 1520–1535 (had children born between at least the years 1558 and 1571) was wife of Östen Eriksson Sursill. They lived in Teg, Umeå, Västerbotten (Västerbotten county).  (S
2 CONC ources:  [http://sursill.net sursill.net]; Elias Robert Alcenius, Genealogia Sursilliana 1850.)
